    {
      "contentTypeKey": "efc614c3-34dd-4262-b6f2-3514575b3ac6",
      "key": "270dd11a-0009-4a01-9c01-000000000009",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "preheading",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What cadets learn"
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "accordionList",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "ef33a691-ec90-4004-8937-73a37ac2a60c",
                "key": "270dd11a-0006-4a01-9c01-000000000006",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "title",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Core abilities"
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "description",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "<p>Core abilities are the broad, life-long skills every cadet needs:</p><ul><li>Apply critical thinking techniques</li><li>Build your capacity for life-long learning</li><li>Communicate using verbal, non-verbal, visual, and written techniques</li><li>Do your share as a good citizen in your school, community, country, and the world</li><li>Take responsibility for your actions and choices</li><li>Treat self and others with respect</li></ul>"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "ef33a691-ec90-4004-8937-73a37ac2a60c",
                "key": "270dd11a-0007-4a01-9c01-000000000007",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "title",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Program outcomes"
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "description",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "<p>Program outcomes describe what cadets know and can do when they finish the programme:</p><ul><li>Act with integrity and personal accountability while leading others in a diverse and global workforce</li><li>Engage in civic and social concerns in the community, government, and society</li><li>Graduate prepared to succeed in post-secondary options and career pathways</li><li>Make decisions that promote positive social, emotional, and physical health</li><li>Value the role of the military and other service organisations</li></ul>"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "ef33a691-ec90-4004-8937-73a37ac2a60c",
                "key": "270dd11a-0008-4a01-9c01-000000000008",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "title",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "Course competencies"
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "description",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "<p>Competencies are discipline-specific skills, knowledge, and attitudes, targeted in each lesson. Cadets show mastery by completing assessment tasks that ask them to:</p><ul><li>Make a decision</li><li>Perform a skill</li><li>Perform a service</li><li>Solve a problem</li><li>Create a product</li></ul>"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "270dd11a-0006-4a01-9c01-000000000006",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
              {
